id: btl_storage_slots
label: Bootloader Storage Slot Setup (Series-3)
package: bootloader
description: >
  The Bootloader Storage Slot component allows the user to configure the various bootloader storage slots.
  It verifies slot overlaps and ensure that storage slots are page-aligned for that particular device.
category: Platform|Bootloader|Storage
quality: production
provides:
- name: btl_storage_slots
config_file:
- path: platform/bootloader/series3/config/btl_storage_slot_cfg.h
  file_id: btl_storage_slot_cfg
- path: platform/bootloader/series3/config/btl_storage_slot_cfg_default.h
  file_id: btl_storage_slot_cfg_default
documentation:
  url: https://docs.silabs.com/mcu-bootloader/latest/bootloader-user-guide-series3-and-higher/07-configuring-the-gecko-bootloader
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: MSLA
root_path: bootloader
